                    "Give yourself some space to process what happened. "
                    "You can be angry, disappointed, and still take care "
                    "of yourself at the same time. 💜\n\n"

                    "What did they do that made you feel betrayed?"
                )
            }


        return {
            "reply": (
                "💭 It sounds like something has really pushed you "
                "past your limit.\n\n"

                "You don't have to suppress the anger, but you also "
                "don't have to act on it immediately. Sometimes giving "
                "yourself a little distance helps you understand what "
                "the anger is actually trying to tell you.\n\n"

                "Maybe you're feeling disrespected, ignored, "
                "disappointed, or simply exhausted from dealing with "
                "the same situation.\n\n"

                "Take a moment before reacting. You can decide what "
                "you want to do once things feel a little clearer. 🌱\n\n"

                "What happened?"
