                "someone's life. 💜\n\n"

                "What happened that made you start feeling this way?"
            )
        }


    # =========================================================
    # SADNESS / LONELINESS
    # =========================================================

    sadness_words = [
        "sad",
        "sadness",
        "lonely",
        "alone",
        "cry",
        "crying",
        "heartbroken",
        "hurt",
        "empty",
        "nobody understands",
        "no one understands",
        "misunderstood",
        "miss someone",
        "i miss"
    ]

    if any(word in lower_text for word in sadness_words):

        if (
            "nobody understands" in lower_text
            or "no one understands" in lower_text
            or "misunderstood" in lower_text
        ):

            return {
                "reply": (
                    "🫂 Feeling like nobody really understands you "
                    "can be incredibly lonely.\n\n"

                    "Sometimes what hurts isn't even being physically "
                    "alone. It's feeling like you could explain what's "
                    "happening inside your head and still wouldn't be "
                    "truly heard.\n\n"

                    "You don't need to make your feelings smaller just "
                    "because other people may not completely understand "
                    "them. What you're feeling is still real. 💜\n\n"

                    "I'm here to listen. You can tell me what has been "
                    "happening lately, even if it feels messy or difficult "
                    "to explain.\n\n"

                    "When did you start feeling this way?"
                )
            }


        return {
            "reply": (
                "🫂 It sounds like you're carrying something that "
                "really hurts right now.\n\n"

                "You don't have to rush yourself into feeling better. "
                "Some emotions need a little time before they become "
                "easier to understand.\n\n"

                "For now, try to be gentle with yourself. You don't "
                "have to solve everything today, and having a difficult "
                "moment doesn't erase the progress you've made. 🌱\n\n"

                "I'm here with you. What has been hurting the most?"
            )
        }


    # =========================================================
    # FEAR / ANXIETY
    # =========================================================

    fear_words = [
        "scared",
        "afraid",
        "fear",
        "worried",
        "worry",
        "anxious",
        "anxiety",
        "nervous",
        "panic",
        "overthinking",
        "overwhelmed"
    ]

    if any(word in lower_text for word in fear_words):

        return {
            "reply": (
                "🫂 It sounds like your mind is carrying a lot of "
